  <h1>Clusy</h1>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      This page is about a project that got out of hand and became a company.
      Clusy started as a hackathon idea. We then took 6 months of intense
      engineering work to build it as a tool for ourselves. Then people started
      using it, Founders, Inc. took us into Off-Season II, and the pet project
      turned into the thing we spend most of our time on. Live at
      <a href="https://www.clusy.io/">clusy.io</a>.
    </p>

